#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:167
msgid ""
"Tells supportconfig to search the file system for all eDirectory instances "
"files. If set, ADD_OPTION_FSLIST is automatically set as well. -e"
msgstr ""
"ບອກໃຫ້ supportconfig ຄົ້ນຫາໄຟລ໌ລະບົບສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ eDirectory instances ທັງໝົດ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, "
"ADD_OPTION_FSLIST ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເຊັ່ນກັນ. -e"

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:170
msgid ""
"A full file list using find from the root of the filesytem. -L, fs-files.txt"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ find ຈາກຮາກຂອງໄຟລ໌ລະບົບ. -L, fs-files.txt"

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:173
msgid ""
"Includes the entire log file, including comments, instead of just "
"VAR_OPTION_LINE_COUNT lines of it. Additional rotated logs are included if "
"available. -l"
msgstr ""
"ລວມເອົາໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກທັງໝົດ, ລວມທັງຄຳອະທິບາຍ (comments), ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນພຽງແຕ່ "
"VAR_OPTION_LINE_COUNT ແຖວ. ລວມເອົາໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກທີ່ໝູນວຽນເພີ່ມເຕີມຖ້າມີ. -l"

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:176
msgid "Minimizes the amount of disk information and detailed scanning. -d"
msgstr "ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນປະລິມານຂໍ້ມູນດິດ ແລະ ການສະແກນແບບລະອຽດ. -d"

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:179
msgid ""
"Normally all of the /var/log/YaST2/* logs are included. This option "
"minimizes the amount of each file retrieved."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກທັງໝົດໃນ /var/log/YaST2/* ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໄປ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຫຼຸດຜ່ອນປະລິມານ"
"ຂອງແຕ່ລະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນມາ."

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:182
msgid ""
"Runs an rpm -V on every installed RPM package. This takes some time to "
"complete. -v, rpm-verify.txt"
msgstr ""
"ດຳເນີນການ rpm -V ໃນທຸກໆແພັກເກດ RPM ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຄາວໜຶ່ງ. -v, rpm-"
"verify.txt"

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:185
msgid ""
"Normally only the base SLP service types are listed. This option allows you "
"to query each of the discovered service types individually. -s, slp.txt"
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະສະແດງພຽງແຕ່ປະເພດບໍລິການ SLP ພື້ນຖານ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສອບຖາມແຕ່ລະປະເພດ"
"ບໍລິການທີ່ກວດພົບໄດ້ແຍກກັນ. -s, slp.txt"

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:188
msgid "Company name to include in the basic-environment.txt"
msgstr "ຊື່ບໍລິສັດທີ່ຈະລວມໄວ້ໃນ basic-environment.txt"

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:191
msgid "Contact's email address to include in the basic-environment.txt"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູອີເມວຂອງຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ທີ່ຈະລວມໄວ້ໃນ basic-environment.txt"

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:194
msgid "Contact's name to include in the basic-environment.txt"
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ທີ່ຈະລວມໄວ້ໃນ basic-environment.txt"

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:197
msgid "Contact's phone number to include in the basic-environment.txt"
msgstr "ເບີໂທລະສັບຂອງຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ທີ່ຈະລວມໄວ້ໃນ basic-environment.txt"

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:200
msgid ""
"The number of lines to include when getting a log file. Zero means get the "
"entire file."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ຈະລວມເຂົ້າເມື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ. ເລກສູນໝາຍເຖິງການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດຂອງໄຟລ໌."

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:203
msgid ""
"The supportconfig tarball location. The first valid location in the list is "
"always used."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບໄຟລ໌ supportconfig tarball. ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ທຳອິດໃນລາຍການຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ສະເໝີ."

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:206
msgid ""
"The maximum number of /var/log/messages lines to get. Zero means get the "
"entire file."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນແຖວສູງສຸດຂອງ /var/log/messages ທີ່ຈະດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ. ເລກສູນໝາຍເຖິງການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດຂອງໄຟລ໌."

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:209
msgid ""
"The maximum number of heartbeat policy engine log files to include in the "
"supportconfig tarball."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ heartbeat policy engine ທີ່ຈະລວມໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ supportconfig "
"tarball."

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:212
msgid ""
"The maximum number of SAR data files to include in the supportconfig tarball."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ SAR ທີ່ຈະລວມໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ supportconfig tarball."

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:215
msgid ""
"When set to 1, supportconfig runs in quiet mode. This option is useful if "
"you\n"
"plan on running supportconfig regularly in a cron job for example. Set with -"
"Q."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ 1, supportconfig ຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດງຽບ (quiet mode). ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຖ້າທ່າ"
"ນ\n"
"ວາງແຜນຈະເປີດໃຊ້ supportconfig ເປັນປະຈຳ ເຊັ່ນໃນ cron job. ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍ -Q."

#: src/include/support/supportconfig_conf.rb:218
msgid ""
"Used to specify where the supportconfig tarball will be uploaded, when using "
"the -u srnum startup option. You can specify any FTP server that supports "
"anonymous uploads. The default is SUSE's public ftp server."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸບ່ອນທີ່ຈະອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ supportconfig tarball ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ -u srnum. ທ່ານສາມາດລະ"
"ບຸ FTP ເຊີເວີໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ຮອງຮັບການອັບໂຫຼດແບບບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນ (anonymous). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ FTP ເຊີເວີສາທາ"
"ລະນະຂອງ SUSE."

#. Initialization dialog caption
